dut/apb_dummy.sv:
  Dummy APB slave, provides non-trivial data on read cycles
  and reports all active cycles to the console.
  You do not need to modify this file.
apb_harness.sv:
  Test harness and test-signals interface, to be constructed
  by delegates according to the scheme shown in the
  "Virtual Interfaces" section of the course.
  Some hints in the file.
apb_classes.sv:
  APB transaction classes:
  - ABP_Trans and APB_Stream classes, taken from the previous exercise
  - APB_Driver bus functional model class, expects to 
    interact with a physical APB bus via virtual interface
apb_pkg.sv
  Package that includes the above classes
apb_tb.sv:
  Top-level module.  Simply runs the environment by calling its
  run() method.  Simulate this in parallel with APB_harness.
files.f:
  Command file for use with the tools' -f option, specifies
  which files to compile
